              "creator": "denyshon@outlook.com",
              "id": 18097865,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "Not sure if there's an easy way to test this, since you need valid credentials, but... here are **STR**:\n1. Go to https://www.tauron.pl/ and click Sign Up (\"Zarejestruj si\u0119\"). This will take you to https://logowanie.tauron.pl/\n2. Click Proceed two times, leaving the first option selected.\n3. Enter the requested numbers (two steps). Looks like you need an active agreement with Tauron to proceed (and an account that hasn't been activated yet).\n4. Set your password and proceed.\n5. You'll end up on https://logowanie.tauron.pl/register/terms-acceptance\n6. On this page, scroll down and click the Accept button at the bottom.\n\n**Expected results:**\nThe next page loads, informing you that an activation link has been sent to your email address.\n\n**Actual results:**\nNothing happens, you see the \"Loading in progress\" message for a short time, but stay on the same page. You can't finish signing up.",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "Not sure if there's an easy way to test this, since you need valid credentials, but... here are **STR**:\n1. Go to https://www.tauron.pl/ and click Sign Up (\"Zarejestruj si\u0119\"). This will take you to https://logowanie.tauron.pl/\n2. Click Proceed two times, leaving the first option selected.\n3. Enter the requested numbers (two steps). Looks like you need an active agreement with Tauron to proceed (and an account that hasn't been activated yet).\n4. Set your password and proceed.\n5. You'll end up on https://logowanie.tauron.pl/register/terms-acceptance\n6. On this page, scroll down and click the Accept button at the bottom.\n\n**Expected results:**\nThe next page loads, informing you that an activation link has been sent to your email address.\n\n**Actual results:**\nNothing happens, you see the \"Loading in progress\" message for a short time, but stay on the same page. You can't finish signing up.",
              "time": "2026-05-22T07:15:35Z"
            },
